WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:02.400
Right.

00:03.360 --> 00:08.440
My father has more words for you yue'er.

00:09.040 --> 00:13.333
I'm afraid I won't live to see Your Highness.

00:14.120 --> 00:15.520
Father.

00:20.360 --> 00:24.680
Tell Your Highness for me this northern expedition.

00:25.360 --> 00:29.360
Could not press on to reclaim the land.

00:30.440 --> 00:31.840
Then we should.

00:32.560 --> 00:35.040
Follow my original plan.

00:35.880 --> 00:40.560
Use Beiyu Pass as a springboard actively prepare.

00:41.360 --> 00:45.320
And wait for the right time yue'er.

00:45.920 --> 00:47.680
I have something.

00:48.800 --> 00:50.800
To give to Your Highness.

00:52.040 --> 00:54.707
General Zu Kun has something to give me.

01:23.040 --> 01:28.840
This is soil from less than two hundred li from Yong'an please take it back, Your Highness.

01:28.920 --> 01:33.840
Let the court's nobles take a good look at this homeland the court.

01:33.920 --> 01:39.520
The court has its own considerations has difficulties and hardships various concerns.

01:39.680 --> 01:41.080
I know.

01:44.120 --> 01:48.120
Heaven did not grant more years only leaving endless regret.

01:56.360 --> 01:58.027
Brothers of the volunteer army.

01:58.720 --> 02:04.160
The war is over I will arrange places for you those willing to take up arms will join the army.

02:04.240 --> 02:08.480
Those willing to take money I will send people to take you to Liangzhou.

02:34.040 --> 02:35.440
I'll follow Your Highness.

02:37.480 --> 02:38.480
Follow Your Highness.

02:38.560 --> 02:44.520
Follow Your Highness good.

02:44.600 --> 02:49.840
Follow Your Highness from today I will form you into a separate army.

02:49.920 --> 02:51.320
Led by General Zhu.

02:51.560 --> 02:52.040
Yes.

02:52.120 --> 02:56.907
Since this army was built in the north I give you the name.

02:57.000 --> 02:58.400
Beishuo Army.

03:00.320 --> 03:01.440
Beishuo Army.

03:01.560 --> 03:02.960
At your command.

03:03.360 --> 03:04.760
Here.

03:09.040 --> 03:12.573
Brother-in-law urgent edict from the Ministry of War.

03:22.000 --> 03:26.760
What is it? Father is gravely ill summoning me to return to the capital immediately at this time.

03:27.480 --> 03:31.600
Go investigate the situation again call Zhu Yuanzhi to discuss together.

03:32.040 --> 03:33.440
Yes.

03:48.800 --> 03:50.200
All investigated.

